    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hard to master. No time limits. No rush. Just relax and merge in pixel-art goodness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy To Learn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join 3 tokens of the same tier to merge them and create the next tier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Time Limits, No Rush</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at your own pace, with no time restrictions. Pause or leave the game whenever you want a break, and continue at your leisure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pixel Art Goodness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy cute 16-bit pixel art graphics. Customise everything from the tokens to the UI theme to suit your tastes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Achievements &amp; Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a range of achievements and compete with both friends and the world for top spot on the leaderboards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hard To Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what is takes to merge the highest tier of token and win a game?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hard to master. No time limits. No rush. Just relax and merge in pixel-art goodness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy To Learn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join 3 tokens of the same tier to merge them and create the next tier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Time Limits, No Rush</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at your own pace, with no time restrictions. Pause or leave the game whenever you want a break, and continue at your leisure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pixel Art Goodness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy cute 16-bit pixel art graphics. Customise everything from the tokens to the UI theme to suit your tastes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Achievements &amp; Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a range of achievements and compete with both friends and the world for top spot on the leaderboards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hard To Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what is takes to merge the highest tier of token and win a game?</p>",
